WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.150
Here it comes, Raimon ruffians!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:12.960
Kaiou Academy makes a fast attack and heads up on the dribble!

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.490
What's with that speed?

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.580
They've passed Shindou and Matsukaze!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.800
Kaizu!

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.330
Coach Endou...

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.750
His path is completely open!

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.880
Flying Fish!

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:34.510
It's in!

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:37.970
Kaiou gets the first goal not long after the starting whistle!

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.940
We will protect Fifth Sector's managed soccer!

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:44.440
We swear it in both name and pride as Seeds!

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.190
This is the power of Seeds...

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.820
It's still one point!

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.230
The match is just beginning!

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.640
Holy Road's Kanto district prelim finals!

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:39.190
The match between Kaiou Academy versus Raimon Jr. High opens with Kaiou immediately scoring 1-0!

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:41.980
Raimon is abruptly pulled behind!

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:46.520
They're no match for us to begin with.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:52.900
Considering their physical abilities, we won't be able to cope with them one-on-one.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.370
Tsurugi! Tenma!

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:55.780
Bring up the passes!

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:56.900
Okay!

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:01.820
The match resumes with Raimon's kickoff!

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.120
Shindou!

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:05.530
Tsurugi!

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:08.700
Matsukaze!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.080
Raimon passes up the field!

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:12.590
Go, Tenma!

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:14.790
Don't lose to them Seeds!

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.770
Kurama-senpai!

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:24.770
Raimon's pass connects!

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:25.970
Here it comes!

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:33.230
Sidewinder!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:41.180
Hydro Anchor!

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:47.660
Kurama's shoot is blocked!

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:48.410
What?!

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:51.750
We're in a whole other class from you guys.

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:53.180
Touga!

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.930
Kaiou moves up this time with an angry wave of attacks!

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:58.880
Raimon doesn't even get a chance to touch the ball!

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:02.630
These guys are really strong...

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:04.490
Tsurugi! Kurama!

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:06.310
Tighten the defense!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.010
Raimon is bringing their forwards back to secure their defense!

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:13.230
And now, Hamano moves in to defend!

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:17.730
Hamano is given the slip!

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:18.460
For real?!

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:22.240
Two move in to stop him!

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.740
Shindou dodges by making a touch!

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:27.260
There's Amagi and Nishizono's defense!

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:30.300
Raimon's fervid defense continues!

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.000
Let's go!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.210
I'll stop you!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.260
Yoshimine slips through their defense!

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:43.380
The second point.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.100
I won't let you make any more goals!

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:48.620
Spiral Draw!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.260
That's...!

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:51.430
What?

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.440
Matsukaze uses a new hissatsu technique!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.110
Yes!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.740
All right!

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:02.820
He did it! You're amazing, Tenma!

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:04.840
Matsukaze!

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:06.460
Tsurugi!

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.760
Here he passes to Tsurugi!

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:11.050
Raimon counterattacks!

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:12.160
I won't let you!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.370
Tsurugi sidesteps him!

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.800
Death Drop!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.540
Hydro Anchor!

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:37.820
It's in!

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:39.160
Tsurugi's tying goal!

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:41.860
Raimon brings the score up 1-1!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.300
He did it! He did it!

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:44.290
We're tied!

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.880
Good job, Tsurugi!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:48.700
Tenma!

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.870
Tenma! You finally got it!

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.730
That hissatsu technique was pretty cool!

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:57.020
Yes! Thank you!

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:06.330
He managed to steal the ball from Yoshimine...

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:08.840
Guess they have <i>some</i>  skill.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:13.860
The match resumes with Kaiou's ball!

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:17.350
The score is currently 1-1 with Raimon's goal tying the score!

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:20.350
Great, let's keep this up and leave them in our dust!

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.480
They're getting excited over scoring one measly point.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.860
Let's go, you scalywags!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:27.950
Aye!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.990
Wanda!

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.820
Kaiou makes an abrupt, quick attack!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:38.750
What the heck! They're completely different from before!

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:40.290
You're not getting through!

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:42.710
Playtime's over.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:47.060
Sonic Speed Barius!

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:52.550
An Avatar!

00:06:58.950 --> 00:06:59.630
Shindou!

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:00.550
Tenma!

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:01.850
Namikawa!

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:06.920
Come out! Sea King Poseidon!

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.240
He can use an Avatar too?

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:20.290
Take this!

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.070
It's in!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:28.550
The score is now 2-1 with Kaiou Academy in the lead once more!

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.880
They finally turned serious...

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:42.170
We can't afford to lose this match!

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:46.820
Dash Train!

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:56.860
Kurumada takes the ball!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:58.080
Shindou!

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:01.040
Tsurugi!

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.900
Kurumada can't pass the ball!

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:07.630
We know you two can use Avatars!

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:10.550
We're not letting you use them!

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:13.320
Kurumada-senpai!

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.040
Raimon's pass connects!

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:21.430
You guys think you can get past me?!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.180
Elite Soldier Pawn!

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.900
A third Avatar user!

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.240
I won't lose!

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:37.070
That's...!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.710
Tenma!

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:41.930
Yoshimine!

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:46.000
Flying Fish!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:55.680
Burning Catch!

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.950
It's in!

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:06.550
An additional point that weighs heavily on Raimon!

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:12.110
There's the whistle!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:16.410
The score is 3-1! The first half ends with Kaiou Academy in the lead!

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:18.160
Damn it...

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:20.700
How do I stop him?

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.290
I told you this game would be hopeless.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.270
We're up against three Avatar users.

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:29.490
There's no way we can win...

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:35.970
As I suspected, the key to winning this game is...

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.480
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:09:47.510 --> 00:09:49.180
Inazuma Eleven...

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:50.060
GO!

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.420
Put in Tenma as goalkeeper?!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.700
Kirino, you fill in for Tenma's position.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.140
Y-Yes, sir!

00:09:58.140 --> 00:10:00.160
Sangoku, you're left-back.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.150
Why are you doing this?

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:08.160
Why make Tenma goalkeeper when he's never played goalkeeper before?

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.520
To win, of course.

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:14.190
T-To win...?

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:18.050
What is Coach thinking?

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:21.490
Could it be...?

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.640
Let's do as Coach says.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:34.410
Sangoku!

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.820
I'm counting on you, Tenma.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.660
Sangoku-senpai...

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.400
Bring me a spare uniform.

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.790
O-Okay!

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:51.540
Sangoku-san...

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.890
Don't make that face!

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:01.880
Since this is how it ended up, you just gotta do it.

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:02.510
But...!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:04.600
You're going to protect soccer, aren't you?

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:07.210
It'll be fine, Tenma!

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:09.770
We'll be there to defend with you!

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:11.600
We won't let them shoot!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:14.030
Shinsuke...

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:18.850
Both teams are back in position!

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:20.610
The match will resume momentarily!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:24.100
Raimon has changed their formation.

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:28.370
Sangoku is moved into defense while the goalkeeper chosen to replace him is...

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.560
M-Matsukaze!

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:34.270
What's this?! Raimon has placed Matsukaze as their goalkeeper!

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:38.080
Since it's come to this, I just gotta do it.

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:39.840
To protect soccer!

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:42.540
Him, the goalkeeper?

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.630
We're seriously being underestimated.

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:47.810
Don't hold yourselves back, men.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:49.060
Sink him!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:49.620
Aye!

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:51.710
We're doomed.

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:55.810
Tenma-kun doesn't stand a chance against a Seed's shoot!

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.260
I see, the goalkeeper.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:11:59.660
There's an idea.

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:03.320
But if we lose another point from here on, Kaiou's victory is secured.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.680
The next point will decide whether this game...

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:10.860
Whether this entire revolution, even, will succeed.

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:14.780
The second half begins!

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:17.820
The score is currently 3-1 with Kaiou in the lead.

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:19.420
Can Raimon catch up?!

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:20.230
Shindou!

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:23.880
We'll definitely win this game!

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:28.040
You think you can break through our defense all on your own?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:28.680
Nagisawa!

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:33.420
Yes, he got past!

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:35.250
Saruga!

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.940
Presto Turn!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.920
Raimon's passes are connecting!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:49.980
The match is running in their favor!

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:51.820
Yoshimine!

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:55.290
This time, Nishizono cuts the ball with his expert jumping!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:55.890
Wow!

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:57.490
Go!

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:01.090
The winds are converging...

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:04.140
Everyone's doing their best.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.130
I have to protect the goal at all costs!

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:11.850
What's wrong, men?

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.670
You call yourselves Seeds?

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:15.940
Where is your pride as Seeds?!

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.290
My pride as a Seed...

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:23.280
Wanda steals the ball!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.740
I won't let you!

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:28.180
We are Seeds!

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:30.500
There's no way we'd lose to you!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:36.570
Sonic Speed Barius!

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:44.990
Raimon's defense crumbles!

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:51.350
Tenma!

00:13:58.110 --> 00:13:59.230
Will I be able to stop him?

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:00.400
Don't back down!

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:04.850
Weren't you going to protect soccer?!

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:06.670
The soccer that you love?!

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:10.360
He's right...

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:14.460
If I let this ball score, everything I've done...

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:18.460
Everything the team has done will all go to waste.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.290
I'll definitely stop it!

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:29.080
We'll protect soccer!

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:50.740
That's...

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.240
Tenma's Avatar...

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:10.790
H-He blocked it!

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:15.310
Incredible! Matsukaze brings out an Avatar and stops Wanda's shoot!

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:22.350
You did it, Tenma.

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:24.200
Kudou-san!

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:25.340
Yeah.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.140
Tenma!

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:30.970
Shinsuke! Did I just...?

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:33.210
Yeah, you brought out an Avatar!

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:36.110
All right!

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:38.350
I finally did it!

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:40.750
I brought out my Avatar!

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:40.750
Tenma-kun blocked the shoot...

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:46.450
Did you make Tenma-kun the goalkeeper in order to draw out his power?

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:47.920
Is that right?

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:55.200
With his specialty in dribbling, Tenma rarely had the chance to receive the ball from the front.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.400
The front?

00:15:56.780 --> 00:16:03.480
In order to bring out his Avatar, he needed to learn how to focus all of his concentration to the front and expand his energy.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:05.810
I see!

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:10.320
Using all of his physical force to hit the ball...

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:13.400
Those feelings he shows while facing the ball...

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:16.570
He keeps teaching me so many things.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.930
Coach!

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:21.870
Can I go back to being goalkeeper one more time?

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:28.510
Now, with Sangoku as goalkeeper once more, the game resumes!

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:32.060
The score is still 3-1 with Kaiou in the lead!

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:33.940
Can Raimon catch up?!

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:36.720
Guys, let's turn this around!

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.710
Okay!

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:42.750
Don't get cocky just 'cause you brought out an Avatar...

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:44.480
Yoshimine!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.110
A long throw?

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:53.280
This goal will decide the match!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.650
But Kirino makes a cut!

00:16:57.270 --> 00:16:58.070
Hayami!

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:01.330
You won't have it!

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:05.220
<i>What's the point of joining the club in this situation?</i>

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:06.990
<i>It's over.</i>

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:08.550
<i>It's all over.</i>

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.800
<i>It's scary...</i>

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.660
<i>Fifth Sector's gotten serious on us. It's all over.</i>

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:22.800
Until now, I always made decisions before I'd even tried anything.

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:26.300
I'd convince myself that it was impossible to do without even attempting to do it...

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:26.690
But...

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.940
<i>We'll protect soccer!</i>

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:35.850
You can't tell whether or not something will work until you try!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:44.120
Zeroyon!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:45.540
Awesome!

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:47.680
Over here!

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.630
Death Drop!

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:59.040
It's in!

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:00.800
Raimon scores!

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:03.730
All right!

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:05.630
Okay, just one more point!

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:07.910
Shindou!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.850
Fortissimo!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.560
It's in!

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:20.410
Raimon finally catches up in a tie!

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:22.700
Impossible!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.540
They took three points from us?

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.110
That's just impossible!

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:31.790
Them fighting against us Seeds at the same level has to be a fluke!

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:39.890
Sonic Speed Barius!

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:46.970
Sangoku-san!

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:46.970
Sangoku-senpai!

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:50.180
I will protect Raimon's goal!

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:55.890
Fence Of Gaia!

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:05.510
He blocked it!

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:09.810
This time, Sangoku uses his new hissatsu technique to defend the goal!

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:11.330
Tenma!

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:14.660
I won't let you!

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:17.400
Sea King Poseidon!

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:41.650
Demon God Pegasus!

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:45.160
I'll send your Avatar to its grave!

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.760
Go!

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:58.130
N-Namikawa's Avatar lost?

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:06.140
Elite Soldier Pawn!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:14.310
Matsukaze charges through two Avatars!

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:15.730
Shinsuke!

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:18.360
Full Throttle Jump!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.130
Hydro Anchor!

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:33.280
It's in!

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:35.790
Raimon finally takes the lead!

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.060
There's the end game whistle!

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:44.850
With an eye-popping turnabout, Raimon wins the championship for Holy Road's Kanto district prelim finals!

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:48.170
They will be moving on to the Nationals!

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:49.680
We won...

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.230
We just won...

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.130
Shinsuke!

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:54.820
Tenma!

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:56.510
We did it!

00:20:57.470 --> 00:21:00.320
We... lost...

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:03.570
Yes! Yes! We won!

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.430
Coach Endou!

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:06.780
Yeah!

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:11.080
Next up is the Nationals.

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:14.090
The revolution finally begins.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:15.530
Yeah.

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:56.130
We have a new member in the soccer club!

00:22:56.130 --> 00:22:57.810
His name is Kariya Masaki!

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:00.270
C'mon, let's power up!

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:04.350
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 The Autumn Sky Challengers!

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:06.480
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:17.910
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.850 --> 00:23:26.580
You can't tell whether or not something will work until you try.

00:23:26.580 --> 00:23:27.410
That's all!
